SUMMARY:Water dispenser: vinegar clean
DESCRIPTION:Half white vinegar\, half water in. Hold the ice button 3 seco
 nds (self-clean\, about 10 min). Drain at the back. Run 2 more cycles wit
 h plain water. Steps: https://safaangit.github.io/dispenser/
URL:https://safaangit.github.io/dispenser/
