RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;INTERVAL=3;BYDAY=1SA
SUMMARY:Water dispenser: deep clean (bleach)
DESCRIPTION:Unplug. Drain. 1 tablespoon plain bleach per gallon of water\,
  sit 5 min\, run out every tap. Rinse 4 times with fresh water. Do the vi
 negar clean after. Never mix bleach and vinegar. Steps: https://safaangit
 .github.io/dispenser/
URL:https://safaangit.github.io/dispenser/
